    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.06",
    "summary": "In your Shooting phase, spend 1 CP on a friendly unit with **EXPLOSIVES** or **GRENADES**. It must be **unengaged**, able to shoot and have made no [Advance Move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) this turn. Pick a model from that unit with either keyword. It must be able to [see](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) an **unengaged** enemy unit no more than 8″ away. Choose one such enemy unit. Roll 6D6. That enemy takes a [Mortal Wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) for every die showing 4 or better.",
